<title>USA: TABLE - InnoServ Q4 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE - InnoServ Q4 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Texas 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr     loss    $0.11	   loss   $1.33</p>
<p> Net     loss    526	     loss   6,721</p>
<p> Revs		9,684		    10,799</p>
<p>	  12   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     loss    $0.31	   loss   $1.43</p>
<p> Net     loss    1,573	   loss   7,189</p>
<p> Revs		42,387		   45,727</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net loss for fiscal 1996 included special charges recorded in Q4 of $2,267,000 resulting primarily from adoption of plan to reorganize operations and from evaluation of the realization of assets, both in support of the company's then new focus emphasizing its comprehensive multi-vendor Asset Management Services Program.</p>
<p>Also, the company recorded a tax provision in Q4 1996 of $2,479,000 as valuation allowance to reduce its net deferred tax asset in conformance with Statement of Financial Accounting Standards No. 109, &quot;Accounting for Income  Taxes.&quot;</p>
<p>Full co name is INNOSERV TECHNOLOGIES INC.</p>
